# Strict Project Rules
- Instagram Embedded Player (<iframe src=".../embed">) is authorized by user.
- Video playback layout must match the split Instagram dialog reference:
  - Left: 9:16 vertical video player (iframe / HTML5).
  - Right: Creator header (with verified badge and follow), full caption, comments thread, and engagement metrics (likes, comments, share, save).
- Zero fake / random fallback videos.
- Maintain 11-phase progress tracker block.
